---
source: crates/news/tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout_of(&[group, \"--help\"])"
---
Home page curation (Frontpage)

Usage: news home [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  candidates  Pages eligible for the home page
  save        Store a draft curation
  check       Code checks on a draft curation
  preview     Render the home page locally with a draft
  publish     Publish an approved curation (G tier)
  show        The live curation and its age
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --limit <N>        Return at most N list items (default 20; `jobs claim`: how many to claim, default 1)
      --fields <A,B>     Keep only these keys of each item, comma-separated
      --cursor <CURSOR>  Continue a truncated list from its next_cursor
  -h, --help             Print help
